{
  "description": "Shared cases for the action-sheet chart and the watchlist mini chart (Android SheetChart.accept / SheetChart.sparklineFor, iOS the same names in WatchSheetChart.swift). 'accept': candles as [UTC epoch day, price] (open = high = low = close = price, openTime = day × 86 400 000); convert = USDT fallback converted to the fiat quote; dailyRates = fiat per USD per UTC day; currentRate = fiat per USD now; expected = first/last close of the accepted series or null (no chart). The fallback is only used when last close × rate (rate of the last candle's day, else currentRate) is within 25 % of the pair price; no pair price or no rate at all = null. 'sparkline': USDT closes of the base asset, pair price and USD per unit of the quote; shown only within 25 % (last close vs price × quoteUsd). Numbers compared with tolerance 1e-9 (relative). 'widget': single-widget chart (Android/iOS WidgetChartGeometry.pairCandles): candles of the pair from the fallback chain (same layout as 'accept'), shown only when the last close is within 25 % of the pair price; no price = no chart (not checkable); invalid candles are dropped first, fewer than 2 = no chart.",
